'''Type-Monshiro''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that is exclusive to the VIP [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] Gacha with a 0.42% drop rate, only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

