==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Type-Swallow Tail''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Type-Monshiro is a backline DPS and crowd-controller, her usage is similar to the likes of [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. She sits in the back and unloads good damage with high pierce via [[Wave Attack]]s, hitting all the way up to 733 range. Her [[Slow]] has a ~33% uptime against Aliens, assuming all [[Fruit Treasures]] are collected, which is further extended up to ~40% if a Wave Attack re-procs it on an enemy. Overall, she's not a bad Uber, and can be used as a generalist waver for many early-game stages. Type-Monshiro is especially useful for [[Into the Future]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]] as a hardcarry against all of the fearsome Aliens.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller|EvolvedClass = Crowd-Controller & Waver|TrueClass=|UltraClass=}}

